        "SRC-000740"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City status: Application Deemed Incomplete. 26 below-market units.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001242"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City project page lists the status as Application Deemed Incomplete; it describes an 8-story, 126-unit project with 26 below-market-rate units and 121 parking spaces on merged parcels at 1320-1330 El Camino Real and 114 Madison Avenue.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001242"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "County parcel data lists APN 053-063-120 at 114 Madison Ave, owner 114 Madison LLC.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002851"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "State Table A2 (2023) reports the earlier plan as 130 units: 7 very-low, 6 low and 13 moderate-income inclusionary and density bonus units, plus 104 above-moderate.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001116"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Redwood City Pulse reports a height of nearly 98 feet, 54 bicycle spaces, a 26,554 sq ft lot, waivers for height, open space, bicycle parking and frontage standards, and replacement of Happy Donuts, The King Mattress and Furniture, and The Record Man.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-000740"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "SF YIMBY reports about 163,000 sq ft total, including 38,800 sq ft for a two-story podium garage.",
      "src": [
